<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="43d50f6d">The project closure template will help clearly summarize and document business needs/issues, how the project addressed the
needs/issues, key milestone dates, work products and lessons learned. Teams can use this document to confirm agreement on
pertinent project closing details. &lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
